/doom/
THINKNODE_M1_HANDOVER.md
CLAUDE.md
# Working docs at the workspace root are local-only: per-topic audit indexes,
# handovers and handoffs.  These were listed one file at a time, which meant
# every new one had to be remembered — and one was not, so it went into a commit
# before anybody noticed.  Match by shape instead; the individual lines below are
# now redundant but harmless.
[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]_*.md
*_AUDIT_INDEX.md
*_AUDIT_HANDOFF.md
*_HANDOFF.md

zephcore/apc_checklist.md
